# Newly generated processed datasets; previously tracked files stay tracked.
data/processed/

# Tracked deliberately, not ignored:
#   models/          saved models behind the reported metrics
#   reports/         deliverables (results, metrics, figures, validation summaries)
#   data/samples/    4 KB demo fixture, regenerated deterministically (seed 42)
#
# Existing raw/processed datasets remain in Git history. The rule above prevents
# additional processed files from being added; it does not remove tracked data.
